# 5. std::future_status

`wait_for()` 和 `wait_until()` 会返回 `std::future_status`。它有三个常见状态：

```cpp
future_status::ready
future_status::timeout
future_status::deferred
```

### ready

结果已经准备好。

```cpp
auto status = f.wait_for(chrono::seconds(1));

if (status == future_status::ready) {
    cout << "ready" << endl;
}
```

### timeout

等待时间结束，任务还没有完成。

```cpp
if (status == future_status::timeout) {
    cout << "timeout" << endl;
}
```

### deferred

任务使用了延迟执行策略。

```cpp
future<int> f = async(launch::deferred, [] {
    return 100;
});

future_status status = f.wait_for(chrono::seconds(0));

if (status == future_status::deferred) {
    cout << "deferred" << endl;
}
```

完整示例：

```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <future>
#include <thread>
#include <chrono>

using namespace std;

int main() {
    future<int> f = async(launch::async, [] {
        this_thread::sleep_for(chrono::seconds(3));
        return 100;
    });

    while (true) {
        future_status status =
            f.wait_for(chrono::milliseconds(500));

        if (status == future_status::ready) {
            cout << "result = " << f.get() << endl;
            break;
        }

        if (status == future_status::timeout) {
            cout << "still running..." << endl;
        }

        if (status == future_status::deferred) {
            cout << "deferred task" << endl;
            break;
        }
    }

    return 0;
}
```

