##  ftell

返回⽂件指针相对于起始位置的偏移量
 1 long int ftell ( FILE * stream )

示例代码：

```cpp
/* ftell example : getting size of a file */
#include <stdio.h>
int main()
{
	long size;
	FILE* pFile = fopen("myfile.txt", "rb");
	if (pFile == NULL)
		perror("Error opening file");
	else
	{
		fseek(pFile, 0, SEEK_END); // non-portable
		size = ftell(pFile);
		fclose(pFile);
		printf("Size of myfile.txt: %ld bytes.\n", size);
	}
	return 0;
}
```


